From 75b612f217b4449c3cff7cc683e1596b18152f1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 12:34:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07986/11362] [outer-loop] preserve concurrent conductor
 transient state before the review-fix commit
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Commit-first, never stash (CLAUDE.md 'Never Stash — Always Commit-First'). The conductor is running
and writing ops/conductor-{log,state,heartbeat} + research-complete.yaml continuously, which races
pre-commit's own stash/restore and reports 'files were modified by this hook' on hooks that modify
nothing (canonical_url_lint.py and check_torch_cuda both exit clean standalone).
---
 .../arc-agi3-leaderboard-technique-watch.md   |   4 +
 docs/research-notes/arc-agi3-news-watch.md    |   4 +
 ...arc_leaderboard_technique_watch_state.json |   6 +-
 ops/conductor-heartbeat.json                  |   2 +-
 ops/conductor-log.md                          | 104 +++
 ops/conductor-state.json                      |   2 +-
 research-complete.yaml                        | 750 ++++++++++++++++++
 ...iment_3583_archive_v329_activate_v330.json |   4 +-
 ...iment_3611_archive_v331_activate_v332.json |   4 +-
 results/experiment_625_tier1_fr11_relay.json  |   6 +-
 results/experiment_638_tier1_fr11_relay.json  |   6 +-
 results/experiment_645_tier1_fr11_relay.json  |   4 +-
 12 files changed, 879 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

